      "jcr:created": "Wed Feb 15 2023 20:46:53 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">All-suture. Endless possibilities</span></span></p>\n<h2><span class=\"fontsize-8em\">The Iconix family of all-suture anchors (Iconix, Iconix TT, Iconix Needles and Iconix Speed) continues to change what’s possible with suture anchor technology. This comprehensive all-suture anchor platform with a needles option, self-punching option and tie-able anchor tape option is designed to fit your orthopaedic needs.</span></h2>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Apr 24 2023 15:04:34 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "cols4": {
