          "text": "<h4><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Fixation with IntelliBraid anchor technology</span></h4>\n<p>IntelliBraid anchor technology creates a one-of-a-kind bunching effect using targeted compression zones within the implants’ sheath for optimal fixation.</p>\n",
