    ],
    "bulletList": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>The simplistic color coded design with IntelliBraid Technology and small drills with Self Centering Technology are designed to reduce the risk of human error, allow for optimal fixation reducing the possibility of loose bodies in the joint and result in minimal bone removal and accurate pilot hole placement.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>The Guide, Anchor, Suture &amp; Obturator options allow for a variety of techniques in numerous repairs. (Iconix Speed is only indicated for rotator cuff repair)</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Anatomic repairs, greater pullout strength<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;and a variety of technique options allow for optimization of OR time.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      }
    }
  },
